OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACelebrity loses injunction bid but will
OL,4,Astay anonymous pending appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FITN and the Guardian have said they
OL,7,Fbelieve it is in the public interest to
OL,8,Fpublish allegations that the man abused
OL,9,Fhis status to attempt or attempt to
OL,10,Fengage in "inappropriate sexual
OL,11,Factivities with a large number of girls
OL,12,Fand young women".
OL,14,FThe man, who denies the allegations,
OL,15,Fsaid any publication would be "highly
OL,16,Flikely" to lead him to kill himself,
OL,17,Fand that the court should prevent any
OL,18,Fpublication or broadcast.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
